<title>ITALY: SOCCER-BOSNIA BEAT CROATIA 3-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOSNIA BEAT CROATIA 3-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>IMOLA, Italy 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bosnia beat Croatia 3-1 (halftime 2-0) in</p>
<p>their European under-21 group one qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bosnia - Uscuplic (29th min, penalty, 38th), Granov (68th)</p>
<p>Croatia - Vugrinec (46)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
</text>
